OL,3,GNEWSADriver born with no arms looking
OL,4,Ato make motorsport history
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver born with no arms says he is
OL,7,Fdetermined to make motorsport history
OL,8,Fby competing at the highest levels -
OL,9,Fusing only his feet.
OL,11,FCallum Smith from Warwickshire learned
OL,12,Fto drive just two years ago but has now
OL,13,Fjoined Team Brit, a competitive team of
OL,14,Fdisabled racing drivers.
OL,16,FThe team has adapted a BMW 1 Series
OL,17,Fspecifically for the driver, who has
OL,18,Fbeen passionate about motorsports since
OL,19,Fchildhood.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
